  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Lord Huang Shi recalls him as a blade path demonic immortal of overwhelming demonic might who rampaged in Western Desert and broke the expulsion formation. Remnant immortal killer moves from his fight with Xi Yuan can still appear in the affected River of Time segment.",
      "chapters": [
        1432
      ],
