    },
    {
      "text": "Spectral Soul’s will names nine-nine reincarnation blades as his most powerful offensive killer move from the deathmatch with Xi Yuan. Nine layers of blade light cycle through eighty-one strikes, and he only used it three times in his lifetime, each use costing a hundred years of lifespan. Narration places him as a blade path legend at the peak of Western Desert and an influential rank eight figure who could have joined Heavenly Court if born in Central Continent.",
      "chapters": [
        1434
      ],
